 <h3><u>Allahu akbar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Allahu akbar</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>(Allahu akbar Allahu akbar) x2 </font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>(Subhe aashoor zara sun azaan-e-akbar hai) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Laila ke phool ki </li>
    <p>shakle rasool ki </p>
    <p>Azaane aakhir hai</p>
    <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar he</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <p>(Ashhadu al-la illaha illallah) x2</p>
    <li>Bol-e-Hussain sun kar takbeer ki sada ko </li>
    <p>Bejang tumne Akbar jeeta hai karbala ko</p>
    <p>Lehjaa ye Mustafa ka ab gunjta rahega </p>
    <p>Jo tere lab par hai </p>
    <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar he</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <p>(Ashhadu anna Muhammadur rasoolullah) x2</p>
    <li>Sar par kafan sajaaye hein sab ba sab namaazi</li>
    <p>Sun kar azaan iqaamat kehne lage hein ghazi</p>
    <p>Hein mutma'in imamat nazdeek hai shahadat </p>
    <p>Ye subhe mehshar he </p>
    <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar he</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <p>Ashhadu anna Alliyun Waliyullah</p>
    <p>Ashhadu anna Alliyun Hujjatullah</p>
    <li>Kya azm hosla hai ansar shah-e-dee(n) ka</li>
    <p>He us taraf jafaayein sajda idhar yaqee(n) ka</p>
    <p>Teeron ka abr barsa jaari hai phir bhi sajda </p>
    <p>Ajeeb manzar hai</p>
    <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar hai</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <p>(Hayya Alas Salaah) x2</p>
    <li>Jhoole mein sone waala bedaar hochuka he </li>
    <p>Nusrat ko shah-e-dee(n) ki tayyar hochuka he </p>
    <p>Maa kehrahi hai beta be teygh jang karna </p>
    <p>Ye hukm-e-maadar he </p>
    <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar he</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <p>(Hayya Alal falaah) x2</p>
    <li>Zainab bhi laadlon ko apne saja rahi hai</li>
    <p>Ibn-e-Hasan ko farwa dulha banaa rahi hai</p>
    <p>Naad-e-ali hai lab par sar par dua ki chaadar</p>
    <p>Ye sheh ka lashkar hai</p>
    <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar he</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <p>(Hayya Ala Khairil amal) x2</p>
    <li>Pyaason ko apni jaanib darya bulaa raha hai</li>
    <p>Lekin har eik pyaasa maqtal ko jaa raha hai</p>
    <p>Na khof hai na dar hai har ek ko ye khabar hai</p>
    <p>Ye raahe kausar hai</p>
    <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar he</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p>
    <li>Rehan ke qalam se Irfan tera lehja,<br> nowho(n) me dhal ke ubhre tute na ab ye rishta,<br> is par dua-e-zehra har dam kiye hai saya<br> ye aisa shaa'ir hai</li>
   </ol> <p>Subhe aashoor zara sun azaane akbar he</p> <p>(Allahu Akbar) x2</p> <p>(La illaha illallah) x2</p></font>
